/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (The Workforce Management System is a centralized relational database designed to automate and streamline core HR operations, specifically focusing on employee attendance, shift scheduling, and leave management. By replacing fragmented manual tracking methods with a unified architecture, the system ensures data integrity and enforces critical business rules, such as validating daily work hours and managing leave approval statuses. Ultimately, this robust database provides a single, reliable source of truth that simplifies administrative workflows, optimizes workforce coverage, and enhances overall organizational efficiency.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
